                <pb facs="0664" n="579" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg579"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.61383/140: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Summerlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-25T19:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic">October 25</hi>
                                [<hi rendition="#italic">26</hi>], <hi rendition="#italic">1919, 7
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received October 27,
                            12.08 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>3245. Hanna telegraphed Oct. 26, 4 p.m. that Jenkins had just telegraphed him
                    from within federal lines and soon would be in Puebla. Ransom was carried to
                    rebel lines this morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
